-harbour","about":"The Address Residences Dubai Creek Harbour apartments offer a unique blend of luxury and serenity, set against the backdrop of Dubai's iconic waterfront. The exclusive residence by Emaar Properties provides an unparalleled living experience with its meticulously designed 1 to 3-bedroom apartments and 3-bedroom townhouses. Live in modern branded homes surrounded by lush greenery and pristine beaches.The townhouses enhance the appeal with rooftop terraces that provide panoramic views of the canal.Beyond its stunning aesthetics, Address Residences at Dubai Creek Harbour boasts world-class amenities that cater to every need. From tranquil swimming pools and a state-of-the-art gym to beautifully landscaped podium decks and dedicated children's play areas, the community offers a perfect balance of relaxation and activity. Its prime location ensures seamless connectivity to the rest of Dubai, with easy access to major road networks, metro stations, and also a water taxi.","price":2000000,"title":"Address Residences","bitrix":{"id":922,"pf_id":"are.2.13280","source":null,"project_id":"Address Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Address Residences Dubai Creek Harbour","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Emaar Properties","project_location":"Al Marjan Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Address_Residences_at_Dubai_Creek_Harbour_35ee113c72.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Address_Residences_at_Dubai_Creek_Harbour_35ee113c72.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2062249,"lng":55.3265974},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Address_Residences_at_Dubai_Creek_Harbour_36e72e61ce.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Address_Residences_at_Dubai_Creek_Harbour_36e72e61ce.webp"},{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Address_Residences_at_Dubai_Creek_Harbour_40e35fd51